      | exact Y1 | exact Y2 | PMK.greg | PMK.greg | PMK.greg | rewrite (KS1 18%nat) by PMK.inl; exact X18
      | exact Y19 | exact Y20 | exact C160 | exact C152 | exact C64 | exact C72 | exact C136 | exact C128 | exact C120 | exact HH1 ] ].
